WEBVTT

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.010
Thank you for being by my side.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.850
<i>Dearest Grandmother,</i>

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:16.010
<i>I'm watching Mikaze-senpai 
film for his movie.</i>

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:21.070
<i>Shinomiya-san and Syo-kun 
are in the movie, too.</i>

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.180
Excuse me...

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.580
You were singing earlier, weren't you?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.540
We'd like to hear that mysterious song again.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.680
Wait...

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:51.800
Sorry, but I stopped singing for other people.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.690
Cut!

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:05.110
Mikaze-senpai, Syo-kun, Shinomiya-san!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.290
Haru-chan!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.870
Nanami! What are you doing here?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.470
I came to discuss the movie's theme song.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.460
We heard the demo tape!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.940
It matched the movie's atmosphere perfectly.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.090
Thanks to Mikaze-senpai's lyrics.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:29.090
It's the theme song. Of course it's perfect.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.990
Ai-chan sings the song at the climax.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.110
I'm excited to hear it.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.070
Are you staying here for a while?

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.570
Yes. I'm going to watch you film.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:48.310
Hooray! Having you around is encouraging.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.660
Right, Syo-chan?

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:50.770
Huh?

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.920
Y-Yeah, I guess...

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.040
Why is having Haruka here encouraging?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.260
B-Because...

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.630
I can try harder when Haru-chan's nearby.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.570
Does that mean you'll make fewer mistakes?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.520
That's got nothing to do with this!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.150
I don't get it.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.090
Being alone is easier and more efficient.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.520
Why would you be with someone?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.490
I don't get this movie either.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.780
These lines at the climax...

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.590
Thank you for being by my side...

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:33.150
I can't understand wanting 
someone by my side.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.110
What?

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.720
Mikaze-san, we're ready!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.050
I'd better go.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:51.220
He hasn't messed up once 
since we started filming.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.730
Not even once?

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.620
It's amazing.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.850
But he doesn't understand the dialogue?

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.640
I don't get Ai.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:14.350
Your lyrics are wonderful.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:18.990
They're overflowing with love 
for connections between people.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.550
They're heartwarming.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:24.910
Heartwarming, huh?

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.060
It's going to rain.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:29.730
What?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.360
Good work, everyone!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.700
Huh?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.620
Rain, huh?

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.840
It's going to get worse.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.060
The rain's really coming down.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.930
Will they be able to film?

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.650
Mikaze-senpai?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:40.670
Oh, no!

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.210
Nanami!

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.900
Syo-kun, Shinomiya-san!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.170
What's wrong?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.720
It's raining outside.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.950
Mikaze-senpai collapsed!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.370
Are you okay, Mikaze-senpai?

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.570
Are you okay, Ai-chan?

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:02.560
Ai, wake up!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.030
He's burning up!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.320
Let's get him inside.

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:17.620
Mikaze-senpai...

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.030
Hey, Ai!

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:20.830
Ai-chan.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:24.100
I'll call the hospital.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.500
There's room for improvement.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.630
Mikaze-senpai?

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.590
Ai-chan?

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.930
What are you...

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:18.010
Now you know I'm a robot.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:21.480
What?!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.090
You're soaking wet.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.730
I forgot my umbrella.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.640
It wasn't raining this morning.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:04.160
Get changed. You'll catch a cold.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.180
Okay.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:11.400
Is it raining where Haruka is, too?

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.000
An idol robot?!

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:26.960
You're kidding. Who would make that?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.480
Shining.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.620
The president?

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:36.180
Shining paid for his ideal idol to be created.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.220
I wouldn't put it past the president.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:43.470
B-But this is too sudden...

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.900
It's up to you whether or not you believe me.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:51.480
Anyway, there's a more 
serious problem right now.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:55.440
What other problem is there?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.320
I'm experiencing problems 
from being out in the rain.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:02.280
What do you mean?

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:08.500
At this rate, I'll run out of power 
before we finish shooting.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.130
But...

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.830
I have 70% power remaining.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:18.980
If I switch between normal and low 
power mode, I'll probably make it.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:23.630
The problem is I start 
overheating in low power mode.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.130
Are you okay?

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.870
What are you doing?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.210
Why don't you go back to your rooms?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.700
We'll help you, Ai-chan.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.660
What?

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.490
We'll help you until we finish shooting.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.610
Is there anything we can do?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.740
You will? Why?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.580
Because it's an emergency.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.290
I don't need help.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:54.420
Why not? What if something 
happens while you're filming?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.770
There's nothing you can do.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.350
It will be more effective if I handle it myself.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.830
I don't want to waste any power.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:02.760
But—

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.040
This is my problem.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:16.760
Mikaze-san, Shinomiya-san, Kurusu-san!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.610
We're ready to start filming!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.000
Action!

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.740
A-Are you okay?

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:30.950
You're still here?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.920
I thought you'd given up and left.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.740
More importantly, you need treatment...

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.190
I'm fine.

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.970
I can handle this myself.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.390
I've always managed by myself until now.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.630
Always alone...

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.570
Cut!

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:55.900
Show me that part again.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:56.580
Yes, sir.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.190
He seems fine.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:04.500
That's good.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:20.500
Ai-chan!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.590
Ai!

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.470
Mikaze-senpai!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.340
Are you okay?

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:42.550
He's hot.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.180
A fever, huh?

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:48.930
Humans take medicine and rest, but...

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.660
Maybe we should try cooling him down.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:54.640
You're right.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.340
We can use fans to cool him.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.650
Where do you see fans?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.380
Then I'll fan him myself.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.290
I'll help.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.730
Me, too.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.610
I don't get it.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:24.600
What?

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:27.530
Kurusu-san, Shinomiya-san!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.820
Do you have a minute?

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.900
Coming!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.980
Ai-chan, we'll be back.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.710
Get some rest.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.630
It's strange.

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:41.580
What?

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.250
Those two...

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:48.590
They've been making fewer 
mistakes since this afternoon.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.110
They're probably doing it for you.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.790
For me?

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:54.520
Yes.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.140
Action!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.780
How can you say you trust me so easily?

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.320
Because you have a song.

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.410
A song?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.480
That song told us.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.670
Your song carried 
on the wind to us that day.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:23.880
You probably secretly 
want the same thing we do.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:27.340
Cut!

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.470
Natsuki.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.900
Are you okay, Ai-chan?

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.960
Let's go rest over there.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.180
You can lean on us, Ai.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.450
Though we may not be very dependable...

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.970
We want to help you.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:57.900
Why?

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.660
No particular reason.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.630
When someone's in trouble, 
you help them out.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.790
That's normal.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.160
Mikaze-senpai...

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.860
Are you feeling all right?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.730
For now.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:32.170
I can probably make it 
to the end of the shoot.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.220
That's great.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.520
Thank you for being by my side.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:44.860
I never understood what that line meant.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:50.630
I thought I could understand if I were 
in the same situation as the movie...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:16:01.350
Thank you for being by my side.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.060
Why doesn't it sound right?

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.170
I'm a robot.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.780
I can't truly understand human emotions.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:19.620
Emotions are simply a tool 
I use to complete my acting.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:24.080
But your performance was wonderful...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.750
Really? That means the 
choices I made were right.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:29.960
What?

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:35.490
I couldn't understand 
wanting someone by my side.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:39.370
Being alone is easier and more effective.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:40.470
I still believe that.

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.130
But...

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:46.360
B-But you seem much closer now to 
Shinomiya-san and Syo-kun

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:49.940
when you talk to them.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:57.660
My AI stores massive amounts 
of information and uses it to learn.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.550
AI...?

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:03.560
The more I learn about someone, 
the more accustomed I become to them.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.920
So do we.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:07.990
What?

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:14.840
The more we learn about someone, 
the closer we become.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:16.670
We're the same...

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.140
Ai!

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.380
There you are.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.590
Haru-chan's with you?

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.600
What's all the fuss about?

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:31.900
I wanted to hear your thoughts on this part.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.860
There's something I wanted to ask you, too.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.280
Think for yourselves.

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.180
Don't be that way.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.290
Come on, tell us.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.280
Please.

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:51.550
Action!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.340
I'm not afraid of being alone.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.090
Let's go together.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.640
I know we can be friends.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:07.230
Don't mislead me anymore.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:31.860
Cut!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:36.860
Mikaze-kun, that improvised fall was great!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:42.300
Thank you.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.190
They're postponing the filming?

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:54.920
Why? All that's left is the climax.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:57.450
Once we shoot that, we'll be finished.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.870
That fall wasn't improvised, was it?

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:08.330
I just froze up because of the heat.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.080
I won't make the same mistake again.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:15.230
But what if something happens 
to make your condition worse?

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.550
There's no problem.

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.090
We're worried about you!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.030
I see.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.940
Ai-chan, please.

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:46.740
Don't push yourself any harder.

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:49.820
Please. You should let 
yourself get better first.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:50.780
Those lines...

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.670
I think I understand what they mean now.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.010
What it means to be with someone.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.130
Mikaze-senpai...

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:05.100
I had no idea such vague 
and unstable data existed.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:10.470
If this is the heartwarming 
feeling you described...

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:13.760
I want to film.

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.250
Thank you

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:01.920
for being

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:07.930
by my side...

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:09.470
I don't mind this feeling.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:10.770
Uta Pri.
